  "_notes": {
    "last_verified": "2026-10-20",
    "source": "Live https://alphafunded.com/ challenge builder read in Chrome on 2026-10-20 (Forex: every funding model, plan and size; Futures: Flex, Daily, Instant Funding, both rule stages) and https://alphafunded.com/affiliates. Earlier: screenshots (2026-09-30) and help-centre rule pages (2026-10-02).",
    "pricing": "promo = the 'Current offer' price, standard = the crossed-out price, both from the live challenge builder on 2026-10-20. The discount is built into the site price (banner 'Get Up To 60% Off'); no code is needed or shown, so promo_code is null on both markets. Forex: 50% off up to $200K, 60% off $300K+. Futures: 60% off. Buying 2-4 accounts together gives an extra 5-15% off each. The futures code FALL is no longer shown.",
    "rule_units": "Forex rules are % of account size. Futures rules are fixed USD amounts.",
    "null_means": "Field not shown on the pricing page. Check the firm's 'View Rules' page before publishing.",
    "rules_source": "Rules checked against Alpha Funded help-center rule pages on 2026-10-02 (1-Step Lite/PRO, 2-Step Classic/Standard/PRO, Instant Standard/PRO, Futures Instant Funding). Instant PRO: 7 profitable days applies to purchases from 2026-10-01.",
    "company_check": "Checked 2026-10-11. alphafunded.com (site code: forex checkout platform selector offers TradeLocker and Match-Trader) and help centre https://faq.alphafunded.com/en/articles/16783963-futures-tradesea-access-how-to (futures accounts use Rithmic credentials on Tradesea). No official page states a founding date or HQ: the homepage only says 'Approved lifetime payouts since 2022', which isn't a founding date, and the legal pages (/terms, /legal-disclosure) are rendered by script and couldn't be read. founded/hq left null. NOTE: the help centre article https://faq.alphafunded.com/en/articles/15363590-what-is-alpha-futures calls the futures side 'Alpha Trader Futures (Alpha Futures)' and the sitemap uses the brand name 'Alpha Trader'. Re-checked 2026-10-20: homepage says 'Approved lifetime payouts since 2022' (payouts, not a founding date), so founded stays null. No Google Maps listing for Alpha Funded found.",
    "changes_2026_10_20": "Instant Funding Standard now also sells a $500K account ($6,000, offer $2,400). Futures 'PRO' is no longer offered; a new futures 'Daily' plan has replaced it (50K/100K at the same prices as the old PRO, 150K now $625). Futures Flex 300K and 450K now show 15 minis max (was 30 / 45). Instant Funding Standard consistency now 'Up to 40%' at payout (was 20%).",
    "futures_daily": "Futures Daily (2026-10-20): evaluation profit target $3,000 / $6,000 / $9,000, EOD trailing max drawdown $1,500 / $3,000 / $4,500, daily loss $1,000 / $1,500 / $2,250, 50% consistency in the evaluation. Funded stage: no consistency, 100% profit split, daily payouts, max withdrawal $750 / $1,500 / $2,250 (recorded as payout_cap). Minimum trading days not shown, so null.",
    "affiliate_program": "https://alphafunded.com/affiliates (2026-10-20): marginal commission ladder on monthly referred revenue - 15% on the first $50K, 20% on $50K-$100K, 25% above $100K. Unique referral code and trackable links; dashboard shows coupon performance. Commission clears after a 14-day refund window; cash withdrawals through RISE (subject to approval), or balance can be spent on Alpha products. Cookie length: not stated. No country or comparison-site rules stated. Apply: https://alphafunded.com/affiliate/login?mode=register"
